# Impeccable harness bundles. Regenerate with:
#   npx impeccable install --project
# The upstream copy is tracked at pbakaus/impeccable; vendoring ~11 MB of
# skill files into a portfolio repo is noise. The detector config in
# .impeccable/config.json IS tracked, because the ignores carry reasons.
# The critique snapshots are NOT tracked: each one is a dated record of a
# moment, and they go stale as soon as the page they describe changes.
.impeccable/critique/
.agents/
.claude/
.codex/
.hermes/
.opencode/
.pi/